        <item>
            <title>0.2.3</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v0.2.3</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Replaced calendar week and month usage totals with rolling 7-day and 30-day totals.</li>
                    <li>Added a separate current-week cost marker and made 30-day comparisons consistent across month boundaries.</li>
                    <li>Improved the menu-bar metrics layout so large costs and 100% values remain readable at a consistent type size.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
